ase v0.3.0\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/kopecmaciej/vi-mongo/blob/master/assets/logo/no-background.svg\" align=\"center\"/>\n\n## What's New\n\n### New Features\n\n- **Query-Aware JSON Export with Path Autocomplete** (by [@hi-im-gabriel](https://github.com/hi-im-gabriel), [#122](https://github.com/kopecmaciej/vi-mongo/pull/122)): Export now provides path autocompletion when building queries, making it easier to select the fields you want to include in your JSON output.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- **Updated README** with install method.\n\n## Thank You\n\nThank you to everyone who contributed to and tested this release!\n\n"}
